    "en": {
      "trackName": "NineCells | Multiplayer Sudoku",
      "description": "NineCells — Where Sudoku Gets Competitive\n\nThink you're fast at Sudoku? Prove it. NineCells turns the classic puzzle into a real-time multiplayer game where every move counts.\n\nONLINE MULTIPLAYER\nGet matched with real players at your level through ELO-based matchmaking. Win matches to climb from Bronze to Master. No bots, no waiting — just real opponents and a live leaderboard.\n\n6 GAME MODES\n• Classic — Pure 9×9 Sudoku, your way\n• Zen — No timer, no pressure, just flow\n• Blitz — Solve as many as you can before time runs out\n• Killer — Cage sums add a new layer of logic\n• Time Bomb — Correct = +4s, wrong = −10s\n• Speedrun — One puzzle, fastest time wins\n• Survival — 3 lives, endless puzzles\n\nDAILY PUZZLE & STREAKS\nA new puzzle every day. Build your streak, freeze the days you miss, and compete on the daily and monthly leaderboards.\n\nPLAY WITH FRIENDS\nStart a match over FaceTime with SharePlay — same puzzle, same clock, head-to-head. Or send a custom challenge to anyone.\n\nACHIEVEMENTS & STATS\nEarn 40+ Game Center achievements. Track times, difficulty splits, and full session history with rich charts.\n\nWIDGETS, WATCH & LIVE ACTIVITIES\nDaily streak widget, weekly heatmap, full Apple Watch app, and Lock Screen / Dynamic Island Live Activities.\n\nDESIGNED FOR FOCUS\nClean interface, zero ads, zero clutter. iCloud sync, full Shortcuts support and Siri intents. Just you and the grid.\n\nDownload NineCells. The online sudoku you've been waiting for.",
      "releaseNotes": "This update is all about multiplayer:\n\n• Fixed matchmaking and connection bugs for smoother, more reliable online duels\n• Improved sync and stability during ranked matches\n• Various performance improvements and minor fixes\n\nThanks for playing NineCells!",
