    {
      "version": "1.1.0",
      "releaseNotes": "Now in 16 languages! NineCells speaks English, Türkçe, Português, 日本語, 简体中文, 한국어, Deutsch, Français, Español, Italiano, Русский, Español (MX), العربية, हिन्दी, Indonesia and Tiếng Việt.\n\n• Brand-new translations for every menu, button and achievement\n• Apple Watch, Widgets and Live Activities fully localised\n• Bug fixes and polish across all multiplayer modes",
      "seenAt": "2026-05-23T15:56:53Z"
    },
    {
      "version": "1.1.3",
      "releaseNotes": "NineCells just got a big multiplayer makeover!\n\n• Versus matches actually work now — pair up in seconds, see your opponent's photo and rank, hit Ready, and trade moves in real time.\n• Play with a friend over FaceTime via SharePlay — synced 5-second countdown, then game on.\n• Climb the league ladder: Bronze → Silver → Gold → Platinum → Diamond → Master. Higher rank, harder puzzles.\n• Match history, opponent stats, a bold \"Your Turn!\" cue, and a gentle red pulse in the last 10 seconds.\n• Now fully translated into 16 languages.\n\nHappy puzzling!",
      "seenAt": "2026-05-27T23:32:18Z"
    },
    {
      "version": "1.1.4",
      "releaseNotes": "This update is all about multiplayer:\n\n• Fixed matchmaking and connection bugs for smoother, more reliable online duels\n• Improved sync and stability during ranked matches\n• Various performance improvements and minor fixes\n\nThanks for playing NineCells!",
      "seenAt": "2026-05-28T16:50:49Z"
